  "instructions": [
    "Rinse quinoa under cold water until water runs clear.",
    "In a medium pot, heat olive oil and butter over medium heat until butter foam.",
    "Add chopped onion and minced garlic, sauté until translucent.",
    "Stir in pul biber and cook for 1 minute to release aroma.",
    "Add quinoa and stir to coat with oil and spices.",
    "Pour in vegetable broth and canned tomatoes, bring to a simmer.",
    "Reduce heat, cover, and cook for 15 minutes until quinoa is tender.",
    "Stir in chickpeas and lemon juice, then simmer uncovered for 5 minutes.",
    "Fluff quinoa with a fork, garnish with parsley, and serve warm."
  ],
